  profileId: sandbox.profile.trial.early
  profileLabel: Trial Early Sandbox
  entryRead: Vhodnoy orientir dolzhen myagko priglashat vnutr zony.
  ambientValue: Obychnaya tsennost dolzhna sidet ryadom s chitaemym prostranstvom.
  detourValue: Pobochnaya tsennost dolzhna pooschryat svobodnye otkloneniya.
  shelterRead: Peredyshka nuzhna, chtoby igrok ne teryal kartinu zony.
  pressureRead: Davlenie dolzhno chitatsya kak perehod k bolee sereznoy vode.
  deepLure: Bolee redkaya tsennost dolzhna lezhat glubzhe rutiny.
  storyLure: Zona dolzhna obeschat ne tolko resursy, no i smysl mesta.
  returnValue: Nazad igrok dolzhen idti po pamyati formy mira.
  freedomRule: Igrok svoboden narushat idealnyy marshrut i stroit svoy.
  curiosityRule: Lyuboy detour dolzhen nesti malenkiy, no chestnyy smysl.
  crosslinkRule: Sosednie pockets i anchors dolzhny obrazovyvat set, a ne trubu.
  reentryRule: Povtornyy zahod dolzhen oschuschatsya bystree i uverennee.
  masteryRule: "Masterstvo \u2014 stroit svoy marshrut po pamyati i risku."
  playerPromise: Svobodnaya podvodnaya ekspeditsiya s chitaemym prostranstvom.
  memoryRule: Igrok dolzhen pomnit prostranstvo po formam i orientiru, a ne po UI.
  dangerRule: Risk dolzhen rasti myagko i chitaemo.
